<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures trading quiet, tone firm.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures trading quiet, tone firm.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian wheat futures remained quiet with a firm tone on Tuesday.</p>
<p>March 1997 rose by A$2.00 to A$173.00 a tonne on one trade while May 1997 rose by A$2.00 to A$174.00 on two trades.</p>
<p>Settlement prices came back slightly on nearer-term contracts. Brokers described the market as very quiet with little interest.</p>
</text>
